- "place": where the scene happens. Give an invented place "facts" too.
- "extras": groups, crowds or creatures in the scene that aren't a single character (a patrol, a crew, a mob), with short "facts". Leave it empty if there are none.
- "goal": what the scene is about, in one sentence.
